   "title": "MFA prompts missing and accounts locking out in Staging (US-West)",
   "description": "We are experiencing widespread authentication issues in our Payment Gateway v2 staging environment (US-West region). Since this morning, about 425 users have reported that their sessions expire unexpectedly. Furthermore, the Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) prompt is not appearing when it should, which is resulting in accounts being locked out automatically after failed attempts. This is blocking our entire QA team from testing. Please investigate why MFA is being skipped and causing lockouts."
