   "title": "Double billing and missing refunds for subscription users in ME",
   "description": "Hello, we have received reports from 4 customers in the Middle East region regarding billing discrepancies on Payment Gateway v2 in production. These specific users were charged twice for their recent subscription renewal. Additionally, when we processed refunds for the duplicate charges via the dashboard, the refunds have not yet reflected in the users' bank accounts or our transaction history. Please check the transaction logs for these IDs."
  },
