   "i": 1682,
   "title": "Missing localization text on Status Page in APAC Dev env",
   "description": "Critical issue in our APAC development environment. The Status Page is currently failing to render localized text for several languages. Instead of the translated strings, we are seeing blank spaces or raw key identifiers. This affects approximately 6,959 users who rely on these pages for incident updates in their native languages. We need the localization files to be served correctly so we can proceed with UI testing."
  },
