   "i": 1685,
   "title": "Queue Manager sandbox issues: SSO errors and duplicate accounts",
   "description": "We are facing a major problem in the Queue Manager sandbox environment in ANZ. Users attempting to log in via SSO are receiving an error page instead of being authenticated. Furthermore, for those who managed to bypass this, duplicate accounts are being created. We are confident this is definitely a rate limit misconfiguration issue within the system causing these bottlenecks and failures. Please adjust the limits to resolve this."
  },
