   "description": "We have identified an issue with Payment Gateway v2 in our ANZ staging environment. 16 test accounts are being charged twice for their subscriptions. We are attempting to reverse these transactions, but the refunds are not being reflected in the system's transaction ledger. It seems like the gateway is not properly handling the refund logic or the duplicate charge detection. Please investigate."
  },
  {
   "i": 1688,
   "title": "Analytics Dashboard Dev (US-West): Webhooks failing to fire",
   "description": "In our development environment (US-West), the Analytics Dashboard is not triggering any outgoing webhooks. We have configured events that should fire a POST request to our endpoint, but no traffic is hitting the destination. This is blocking our ability to test data integrations. Please verify if the webhook dispatcher is active in this region."
  },
